stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Evaluating
  Evaluating --> PASS : checks satisfied with evidence
  Evaluating --> FAIL : observed contradiction
  Evaluating --> INCONCLUSIVE : missing evidence or failed condition
  PASS --> Authorized : current mandate for this artifact
  PASS --> Blocked : no mandate (exit 4)
  FAIL --> Blocked : exit 2
  INCONCLUSIVE --> Blocked : exit 3
  Authorized --> [*] : exit 0
  Blocked --> [*]
